Match the Drupal 12 signature of getDefaultOperations().

EntityListBuilder::getDefaultOperations() takes a CacheableMetadata argument,
which these list builders do not declare, so PHP rejects the overrides while
the module installs.

diff --git a/src/Controller/EckEntityBundleListBuilder.php b/src/Controller/EckEntityBundleListBuilder.php
--- a/src/Controller/EckEntityBundleListBuilder.php
+++ b/src/Controller/EckEntityBundleListBuilder.php
@@ -4,6 +4,7 @@

